<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23985" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">instĭtūtĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		instituo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>disposition</i>, <i>arrangement</i>
			(class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rerum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 2, 13, 35</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Custom</i>, <i>manner</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">institutionem suam conservare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 1, 17, 10</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>Instruction</i>, <i>education</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">doctoris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					de Or. 3, 9, 35</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puerilis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 1, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">de aliqua re,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Off. 1, 2, 7</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>D.</b>
			<i>Principles</i>, <i>elements of
				instruction</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">complures Graecis institutionibus eruditi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 1, 4, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex institutione Stoica se agere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ben. 2, 20, 2</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>E.</b>
			<i>Induction</i>, <i>appointment</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">heredis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Just. Inst. 1, 14, 3</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Gai. Inst. 2, 116</span></i> sqq.</div>
